Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, UN 6 CHICOM. Secret; Sensitive;
                    Immediate; Nodis. Drafted by Feldman;
                    cleared by Assistant Secretary Green,
                        Herz, and Curran; and approved by Secretary Rogers. Sent to London, Brussels, Manila, Seoul, The Hague, and
                    Bangkok and repeated to USUN, Taipei, Hong
                    Kong, Wellington, Canberra, Tokyo, and Djakarta.
